      "name": "Cubic Dimension",
      "effect": "When this card is activated: You can add 1 Level 4 or lower \"Cubic\" monster from your Deck to your hand. Neither player takes any battle damage from battles involving 2 monsters. Once per turn, during your Main Phase: You can Special Summon 1 \"Cubic\" monster from your hand, ignoring its Summoning conditions. If a monster(s) is destroyed by battle: Its controller takes damage equal to its original ATK. You can only activate 1 \"Cubic Dimension\" per turn.",
